1. Happy Path 
{ "username": "john_pork", "email": "John@Mail.com", "password": "Password123" }
201 created: 

2. Same username again, with a different email:
{ "username": "john_pork", "email": "other@mail.com", "password": "Password123" }
409 conflict: "Username already taken."

3. Same username with a different username: (proves citext)
{ "username": "JOHN_PORK", "email": "other@mail.com", "password": "Password123" }
409 conflict: "Username already taken."

4. Same email, different case, with a new username:
{ "username": "jane_doe", "email": "JOHN@MAIL.COM", "password": "Password123" }
409 conflict: "Email already taken."

5. Short username
{ "username": "ab", "email": "a@mail.com", "password": "Password123" }
400 bad request: field error

6. Username with a space
{ "username": "bad name", "email": "a@mail.com", "password": "Password123" }
400 bad request: field error

7. Username with a invalid email
{ "username": "valid_user", "email": "not-an-email", "password": "Password123" }
400 bad request: field error

